# MMK-WP (`mmk-wp/`)

- Separate **WordPress / PHP** codebase (**Git submodule**). Not part of the Next.js bundle or Bun API tree.
- Do **not** import TypeScript from `frontend/` or `backend/` here, or vice versa.
- Prefer this subtree’s own README, Composer/NPM tooling (if present), and WordPress idioms (`wp_enqueue_*`, hooks, themes, plugins).
